<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="About Precious Star Heritage Academy — mission, vision and values">
  <title>About Us | Precious Star Heritage Academy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public.css">
</head>
<body class="public-body">
  <%- include('../partials/public-navbar') %>

  <section class="hero" style="padding:3rem 1.5rem;">
    <h1>About PSHA</h1>
    <p>A community dedicated to academic excellence, character and service.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Mission</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      To provide a safe, stimulating learning environment where every child is known, challenged and supported to achieve their full potential — academically, socially and morally.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <h2 class="section-title">Our Vision</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      To be a leading Nigerian school recognised for excellence in teaching, character formation and the preparation of confident, compassionate leaders.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Core Values</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">E</div>
        <h3>Excellence</h3>
        <p>We pursue high standards in learning, teaching and conduct.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">I</div>
        <h3>Integrity</h3>
        <p>Honesty and accountability guide our decisions and relationships.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">R</div>
        <h3>Respect</h3>
        <p>We honour the dignity of every member of our school community.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">S</div>
        <h3>Service</h3>
        <p>We prepare students to contribute positively to society.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <h2 class="section-title">School life</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
      From classroom learning to sports, clubs and cultural activities, PSHA offers a balanced programme that develops the whole child.
      Parents are partners in education — with access to portals for attendance, results and fees.
    </p>
    <div style="text-align:center;">
      <a href="/gallery" class="btn btn-primary">See our gallery</a>
      <a href="/admissions/apply" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-left:8px;">Admissions</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/public-footer') %>
</body>
</html>
